      "instruction": "Questions 14–18: Complete the summary below. Choose NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS from the passage for each answer. Questions 19–22: Which paragraph contains the following information? Write the correct letter, A–H. Questions 23–26: Match each bird with the point which it illustrates, A–G.",
      "wordLimit": "NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS",
